      "id": "feature_adoption",
      "title": "Feature adoption",
      "narrative": "Notification usage is the standout this quarter. showNotification fired 12,722 times, up from 6,167, more than doubling quarter on quarter. setDiscount stayed steady, 3,507 uses against 3,225 prior, a modest 8.7% rise.\n\nTwo entitled capabilities sit unused: acceptCoupon and rejectCoupon have never fired despite being included on the plan. Both are available capability today, not a gap to close urgently, but worth a conversation if coupon-based promotions are on the roadmap.",
